# wip677: the ARP page's new look, part 1: a keyboard on the left, the 8 white-key rows, balls at the notes of the SELECTED voice.
# Steps are put on voice 1 with notes (sequencer page, then REC + PLAY on ARP is not needed: the scenario writes them with keys).
wait 300
tap ARP
expect arp 1
shot arp_view_empty.png
tap PLAY
tap REC
wait 120
shot arp_view_rec.png
tapkey 7
wait 400
tapkey 11
wait 400
tapkey 19
wait 400
tapkey 0
wait 700
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 100
shot arp_view_notes.png
tap OCT+
shot arp_view_oct1.png
# wip680: the same notes in the old DARK skin (palette 0): the 'no note' ball (the C key at octave 0) gets a hollow white ring, the normal balls are white too
tap OCT-
palette 0
shot arp_view_dark.png
palette 6
